		{
			title: "Decked Again"
			x: -1.25d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Gut of the Cards"
			description: [
				"&dWell, like we mentioned before, Bandit, Cards and Card Decks are a mid-game mechanic."
				""
				"&5One we feel is too fun to keep to mid-game. Who doesn't like gathering and collecting cards?"
				""
				"&dExactly! And now you'll find them in Completion crates, the market, bounties, and rarely as loot."
				""
				"&5Aye, though that last one is only in Treasure Rooms. Except...Thinking what I'm thinking, sis?"
				""
				"&dYep. I'll try to sneak them into Enigma chests in Raw Vaults (wait, didn't I already? Hmm...), and rarely in....how about Dungeon Barrels? More incentive to peak into those."
				""
				"&5Oh, ye should make the Starter deck real quick, the FOPs system looks out for it to see if ye have been progressing well."
			]
			dependencies: ["0332B6DA83347AEB"]
			id: "24E1C6762864AEC6"
