			}]
		}
		{
			title: "G...50..."
			x: 3.25d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "BINGO!"
			description: [
				"&dThe final new Vault Objective (aside from the 'final boss' of the FOPGame Server...) just unlocked for you."
				""
				"&5Aye, and it's an interesting one, Bandit! It's called....Bingo."
				""
				"&dYep, you get to play Bingo. But its a very different version of Bingo. You get a board. It isn't 5x5, it's 4x4. Ye can see the full board by holding TAB, and use Scroll Wheel to select which line ye see up top."
				""
				"&5And each space is a different task. It could be loot certain types of chests."
				""
				"&dSometimes its kill certain types of mobs. "
				""
				"&5Ye get enough Bingo spots to get a line, and ye have completed the Bingo objective. But get more lines, and ye get more loot in the crate!"
				""
				"&dTo officially complete a Bingo Vault, you'll need to find a Grid Gateway to submit your Bingo Board."
			]
