		{
			title: "The Challenge"
			x: 10.75d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Win Streak"
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, Level 65 is around where the new mechanics stop for the FOPGame Server's version of Vault Hunters. Though you already have your hands full with Hacked Vaults..."
				""
				"&5Aye, but ye might as well know : other than the final boss fight with the Herald, ye also open up the Challenger's Vault Rock."
				""
				"&dThis is a special Vault Rock that, well...challenges you to complete as many Vaults as you can in a row."
				""
				"&5Each completed Vault makes the next ones harder, just to warn ye. Completing a Challenge Vault gets you the Challenge Vault Rock back, the counter on it ticked up."
				""
				"&dEventually the Vaults will become too difficult to complete, and you'll lose the Challenger Vault Rock. But you'll get a thing called Embers depending on how many Vaults you completed."
				""
				"&5Aye, and ye can make an Ascension Forge to spend yer Embers on. Ye can buy special Transmogs, or Titles that'll show up with your name in Chat."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"1BF7382696E1F780"
