		{
			title: "BINGO!"
			x: 3.25d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "No, Four Corners Doesn't Count!"
			description: [
				"&dEarning a Bingo Crate can be fairly difficult, Bandit."
				""
				"&5Much like Scavenger, the crate is decent. Even better if ye get multiple lines!"
				""
				"&dOnly things we can suggest is look over your board in the Portal room, before your timer starts."
				""
				"&5Choose a line ye think ye have a good chance of completing. But be ready to shift gears if ye get lucky..."
				""
				"&d...or unlucky. You might need a more versatile build for Bingo Vaults, but that's up to you."
			]
