		{
			title: "Breaking the System"
			icon: "tfb2:token_hacked"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Hack the Planet!"
			description: [
				"&dThank you Bandit for giving me enough time to set all this up. We've got enough of the Audubon Worm into their system that it masked me creating Hacked variants of the regular Objectives."
				""
				"&5Hacked? How so?"
				""
				"&dSo each Objective pulls from a limited list of resources and rewards. I've unlocked a LOT wider variety of rewards. The catch is, the system will know the system has been hacked and will try to stop you."
				""
				"&5Wait, won't they just kick Bandit from the Vault and shut it down?"
				""
				"&dNope. With all of Bandit's work, we now can't be removed without a full system shutdown and a month, minimum, of deep system cleaning."
				""
				"&5So how are they going to try to stop Bandit?"
				""
				"&dBy killing them in the Vault, of course. The security systems will be activated for any Hacked Vault, which will make them MUCH harder to complete. But the rewards are much higher, too."
				""
				"&5Fantastic, sis. Bandit, take these Blank Seals. You'll need em to make the Hacked Seals. If ye complete any of em, ye'll get a Hacked Token."
			]
			dependencies: ["282405CB9D08908F"]
			id: "73F19D407DDBD157"
			tasks: [{
				id: "68AEFEFD96608158"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "6BF14201D2966181"
				type: "item"
				item: "the_vault:crystal_seal_empty"
				count: 5
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Elixir : Hacked!"
			x: 9.25d
			y: -4.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "An Enchanted Adventure"
			description: [
				"&dAlright Bandit, I call the Hacked variant of Elixir Vaults: Enchanted Elixir Vaults."
				""
				"&5Ye'll be needing a bit more Elixir to complete the Vault, for starters."
				""
				"&dYep, but thats the least of your worries. The FOP Security System will activate when you hit certain milestones in the Elixir you've gathered."
				""
				"&5Aye, it'll try to activate 'events' that will kill you. Special mobs being summoned, strange debuffs, etc."
				""
				"&dI've done what I can to mitigate some of these. Occasionally you'll get good events too, like extra loot!"
				""
				"&5Though, if ye have some assistants with ye, Bandit, be warned. These 'events' can cascade off one of you to another, creating a deadly chain."
			]
			dependencies: ["73F19D407DDBD157"]
