		{
			title: "Braziers : Hacked!"
			x: 9.25d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "A Ghost of a Time"
			description: [
				"&dThe Hacked variant of Light the Braziers we are going to call : Haunted Braziers."
				""
				"&5The system will immediately know something is wrong here. Ye'll find a couple new 'modifiers' on a Haunted Brazier Crystal."
				""
				"&dBe careful: One of these causes Wraiths and Ghosts to spawn in every room you enter. The other causes mob attacks to sap a little bit of your Vault Timer. Much like touching Void Liquid does."
				""
				"&5Aye, and the Braziers can have nastier effects as well."
				""
				"&dI've done my best to temper the system response by increasing the loot you can get for pillaging, Bandit. As well as some beneficial modifiers to the Braziers."
			]
			dependencies: ["73F19D407DDBD157"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
