		{
			title: "A Rare Pedestal"
			x: 0.5d
			y: -4.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "A Prize on Display"
			description: [
				"&dWhen you finally get into a Treasure Room, Bandit, you'll find one of two things: a Treasure Chest or a Treasure Pedestal."
				""
				"&5Unlike the Treasure Chest, there is only one piece of loot on a Treasure Pedestal. But this is the only way to get two of the rarest treasure rewards: The Treasure Card Deck, and a unique Treasure Magnet."
				""
				"&dEven if its one item, these are usually good ways of finding Wold Star Chunks, which you'll want for high end items, Bandit."
			]
