		{
			title: "Bingo : Hacked!"
			x: 9.25d
			y: 0.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "Dab For Mercy"
			description: [
				"&dHacked Bingo Vaults are very interesting, Bandit. I dub them : Ballistic Bingo."
				""
				"&5Ye'll notice the board is bigger, of course, as the system already detects the hack attempt."
				""
				"&dYep, but since it can't close it, it'll try to kill you by causing an Event to activate every Bingo space you get."
				""
				"&5Aye, and if ye happen to get a line? Something more significant happens."
				""
				"&dI've done my best to even things out. When you get a space, you SHOULD get both a good and a bad event."
			]
			dependencies: ["73F19D407DDBD157"]
