		{
			title: "Liquid Cards"
			x: -1.25d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Squeezing Juice From Cardboard"
			description: [
				"&5Something you'll start noticing, Bandit, is as you level above 50, Cards will become more and more common."
				""
				"&dGood cards, however..."
				""
				"&5Right. You'll start collecting tons of useless commons. Well, they aren't useless, but they are taking up room."
				""
				"&dThe FOP realized they could get useless cards back into circulation by letting you \"extract\" essence from them to make OTHER cards better."
				""
				"&5Aye, enter the Card Essence Extractor. Put a card in the left side, apply a Redstone Signal, and the card gets 'juiced' into Essence."
				""
				"&dIt just puts the card back into the loot pool, BUT we can use that to get more 'glitched' items into the system."
				""
				"&5The slot in the center holds any Card that can be upgraded with Essence. Usually Evolving or similar cards."
			]
