		{
			title: "Big Box of Fun"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "We're Beyond Mega Now"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, a lot of these tests and attempts to break more into the system has paid off, Bandit."
				""
				"&5We got a really good box for ye set up and in the system now."
				""
				"&dIt's called the Omega Box. I've thrown it into the Dungeon Pedestal pools, and the completion crates for some.... special Vault Objectives I'm working on. Occasionally it'll show up in Bounties and the Market as well."
				""
				"&5It contains a variety of excellent loot. Powerful resources, some of them we came up with, some of them already in the system."
				""
				"&dThis includes the coveted Wold Chunks, which ye'll need to make FOPGame Server breaking items."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
