		{
			title: "Hanging In There"
			x: 3.75d
			y: -4.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Come On Baby, Hold Together..."
			description: [
				"&dBandit, I've been able to whip up a new item for you. It's fairly expensive, but given how hard it is to get the perfect piece of gear..."
				""
				"&5...only for it to only last so long..."
				""
				"&d...I decided to come up with the Repair Augmenter. Using this, you can add an extra Repair slot to a piece of gear."
				""
				"&5Just combine the two in an Anvil. Helps get a bit more use out of yer best equipment."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
